# Seeded canvas payloads are build output: ~2.5 MB each, regenerable with
# seed-canvas.mjs from gen.mjs + the .dc.html artboards. The durable record is
# the source plus the published artifact URL in each folder README.
#
# Matches the seeded OUTPUT (one .html at a folder root) without catching the
# .dc.html artboards, which ARE the design content and stay tracked.
*/*.html
!*/*.dc.html
